# Olist Data Warehouse Project

## Bronze and Silver Layer Data Quality Validation Framework

---

# Overview

This document contains the complete Data Quality Validation Framework used during the development of the Olist Data Warehouse project.

The objective of these validation scripts is to ensure that data loaded into the Bronze and Silver layers is:

* Accurate
* Consistent
* Standardized
* Reliable for analytics
* Free from duplicates and invalid records

These checks were performed before and after transformations to validate the integrity of the ETL process.

---

# Validation Strategy

The validation process was divided into the following categories:

| Validation Type           | Purpose                                |
| ------------------------- | -------------------------------------- |
| NULL Checks               | Detect missing critical values         |
| Duplicate Checks          | Ensure entity uniqueness               |
| Blank Value Checks        | Detect empty string issues             |
| Standardization Checks    | Validate formatting consistency        |
| Business Rule Validation  | Ensure business logic correctness      |
| Range Validation          | Detect impossible or invalid values    |
| Date Validation           | Verify chronological consistency       |
| Derived Metric Validation | Validate calculated analytical columns |

