# 6. ORDER REVIEW DATA QUALITY VALIDATION

# Table: bronze.olist_order_reviews

# ====================================================================

## Business Objective

Review validation supports customer satisfaction,
NPS analysis, and sentiment reporting.

---

## 6.1 Check NULL Values

```sql
SELECT
    SUM(CASE WHEN review_id IS NULL THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS review_id_nulls,
    SUM(CASE WHEN order_id IS NULL THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS order_id_nulls,
    SUM(CASE WHEN review_score IS NULL THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS review_score_nulls,
    SUM(CASE WHEN review_comment_title IS NULL THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS review_title_nulls,
    SUM(CASE WHEN review_comment_message IS NULL THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS review_message_nulls,
    SUM(CASE WHEN review_creation_date IS NULL THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS review_creation_nulls,
    SUM(CASE WHEN review_answer_timestamp IS NULL THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS review_answer_nulls
FROM bronze.olist_order_reviews;
```

---

## 6.2 Check Duplicate Reviews

### Purpose

Ensures review uniqueness.

```sql
SELECT
    review_id,
    COUNT(*) AS duplicate_count
FROM bronze.olist_order_reviews
GROUP BY review_id
HAVING COUNT(*) > 1;
```

---

## 6.3 Validate Review Score Range

### Purpose

Review score should remain within valid rating range.

```sql
SELECT DISTINCT review_score
FROM bronze.olist_order_reviews
ORDER BY review_score;
```

---

## 6.4 Detect Empty Review Messages

### Purpose

Identifies reviews with missing written feedback.

```sql
SELECT *
FROM bronze.olist_order_reviews
WHERE review_comment_message = '';
```

---

## 6.5 Validate Review Timeline Consistency

### Purpose

Review responses should not occur before review creation.

### Expected Result

No rows returned

```sql
SELECT *
FROM bronze.olist_order_reviews
WHERE review_answer_timestamp < review_creation_date;
```

---

## 6.6 Analyze Duplicate Review Records

### Purpose

Further investigation of duplicate review identifiers.

```sql
SELECT *
FROM bronze.olist_order_reviews
WHERE review_id IN (

    SELECT review_id
    FROM bronze.olist_order_reviews
    GROUP BY review_id
    HAVING COUNT(*) > 1
)
ORDER BY review_id;
```

